  "script": "Agar aapko lagta hai ki sirf zyada content post karne se growth aayegi, to shayad aap galat cheez pe focus kar rahe ho. Asli fark padta hai ki log aapke video ke pehle kuch seconds mein rukte hain ya nahi. Agar hook weak hai, to achha content bhi ignore ho jata hai. Isliye agli reel banate samay, pehle hook likho, phir baaki script. Aur publish karne ke baad sirf views mat dekho. Watch time aur retention bhi check karo. Jo format kaam kare, use repeat karo. Yahi smart growth hai.",
